From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: prospero-win <prospero-win@invalid>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 12:00:00 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] dinput: Offer the PS5 title's controller as a joystick.

A PS5 title runs Wine in its own process and cannot start winedevice, so
the HID stack that dinput enumerates joysticks through (winebus, hidclass)
is never there, and a game that reads its controller through DirectInput
found none (patch 0470 gave XInput its controller, nothing gave dinput
one).

dinput gains a joystick, joystick_ps5.c, for the controller the title
keeps in its sink. It reads that state through the Unix library patch 0470
adds to xinput (xinput1_3.so, loaded by name, so there is no library of its
own): where the library is missing, as anywhere but in a title, or the title
has no controller connected, joystick_hid.c lists what it always did.
- hid_joystick_refresh_devices adds the controller to the joystick cache
  under a path of its own, after the HID devices, and a failed HID listing
  no longer hides it;
- hid_joystick_create_device creates this joystick for that path.
dinput and dinput8 build the same sources, so both see it.

The device is laid out as an Xbox 360 controller is on Windows: X and Y
(left stick, y down), Z (the triggers, the left one positive), X and Y
rotation (right stick), a hat switch (the d-pad) and ten buttons (A, B, X,
Y, LB, RB, Back, Start, L3, R3). It reports 045e:028e, as xinput does, and
a path with "ig_00" in it, for games that leave XInput controllers to
XInput. The axes keep the application's range, dead zone and saturation
as joystick_hid.c's do. A periodic timer stands in for the report event of
a HID device, so buffered data and event notifications keep flowing between
polls, and Poll reads the newest state. There is no force feedback yet.
---
 dlls/dinput/Makefile.in      |   1 +
 dlls/dinput/dinput_private.h |   5 +
 dlls/dinput/joystick_hid.c   |  11 +
 dlls/dinput/joystick_ps5.c   | 614 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 dlls/dinput8/Makefile.in     |   1 +
 5 files changed, 632 insertions(+)

